WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.342 --> 00:00:07.175
- I don't know.

00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:09.296
I mean, it was okay, but it seems

00:00:09.296 --> 00:00:11.842
like every single
superhero movie these days

00:00:11.842 --> 00:00:14.834
is just an excuse for the
good guys to fight each other.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.954
- Oh, I know, it's like they
think up the lamest excuse

00:00:17.954 --> 00:00:19.387
for 'em to be mad at each other

00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:22.428
just so they can stage a
big fight scene at the end.

00:00:22.428 --> 00:00:23.725
- I mean, I still liked it.

00:00:23.725 --> 00:00:25.843
I'd give it three stars.

00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:28.248
- Yeah, I'd give it 3.5.

00:00:28.248 --> 00:00:30.099
- Well, you mean 3 1/2.

00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:32.065
- Yeah, the same thing.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.420
3.5, 3 1/2.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.220
- It's not the same thing.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.836
No one uses decimal points
when they rate a movie.

00:00:37.836 --> 00:00:39.783
It's just stupid.

00:00:39.783 --> 00:00:42.270
- I use decimal points to rate a movie.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.373
And I just did.

00:00:43.373 --> 00:00:45.416
- You know, there are times,
and this is one of 'em,

00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:47.873
when I just wanna smash you!

00:00:47.873 --> 00:00:49.332
- Well, why don't you try it

00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:51.165
right here, right now?

00:00:52.881 --> 00:00:54.001
- Oh yeah!

00:00:54.001 --> 00:00:55.609
It is on!

00:00:55.609 --> 00:00:59.107
(Andy laughing angrily)

00:00:59.107 --> 00:01:02.949
(dramatic drums beating)

00:01:02.949 --> 00:01:05.407
(thunder crashing)

00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:07.324
You just started a war.

00:01:08.405 --> 00:01:11.238
- I'm gonna enjoy taking you down.

00:01:12.494 --> 00:01:15.536
Wait, wasn't it just day time and sunny?

00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:17.758
- Don't question it, Andy.

00:01:17.758 --> 00:01:21.925
If we're gonna fight, it'd have
to be in the rain at night.

00:01:22.948 --> 00:01:24.740
- And why are we fighting again?

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:26.513
- It doesn't matter!

00:01:26.513 --> 00:01:30.017
People pay billions of
dollars to see this shit.

00:01:30.017 --> 00:01:32.181
(dramatic chord)

00:01:32.181 --> 00:01:34.706
(thudding)

00:01:34.706 --> 00:01:37.456
(Conan grunting)

00:01:39.604 --> 00:01:40.765
(loud crack)

00:01:40.765 --> 00:01:45.094
(audience murmurs in shock)

00:01:45.094 --> 00:01:48.094
(audience laughing)

00:02:00.468 --> 00:02:01.301
Hey, Andy!

00:02:03.117 --> 00:02:04.581
Do you bleed?

00:02:04.581 --> 00:02:07.581
(audience laughing)

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:17.159
(loud thud)

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.357
(laughing)

00:02:19.357 --> 00:02:21.924
Tell the Devil Conan sent ya.

00:02:21.924 --> 00:02:24.167
(laughing)

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:26.155
(ominous chord)

00:02:26.155 --> 00:02:28.905
(Conan grunting)

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:45.862
(dramatic music)

00:02:45.862 --> 00:02:48.945
(footsteps thumping)

00:02:52.781 --> 00:02:55.781
(audience laughing)

00:03:06.216 --> 00:03:07.514
- I'm gonna hit you bald.

00:03:07.514 --> 00:03:08.384
- Big deal, I'll punch you back.

00:03:08.384 --> 00:03:09.854
- Oh no you won't.

00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:11.306
Quit it, I'm pinching you so hard

00:03:11.306 --> 00:03:13.060
that you will forget how to pinch.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.143
- Stop it!

00:03:14.143 --> 00:03:16.197
(audience laughing)

00:03:16.197 --> 00:03:17.544
(ominous music)

00:03:17.544 --> 00:03:20.544
(audience cheering)

